<header class="atl-head">
  <h1 class="research-title">World Timeline</h1>
  <p class="ref-lede">Five thousand years of states and empires on one line, region by region. Each bar runs from a state&#8217;s founding to its end; gold bars have a full profile. Drag sideways to travel through time, pinch or hold Ctrl and scroll to zoom.</p>
</header>

